  "description": "Stored query QP (PARAMETERS pN LONG; SELECT ID, N FROM F WHERE N >= pN ORDER BY ID). Through QueryDef QP set Parameters pN 30; OpenRecordset dynaset; walk ID and N; set pN 55; Requery with no argument, MoveFirst, walk; Requery(qd), MoveFirst, walk; set pN 15; Requery(qd), MoveFirst, walk; read Type; Requery with Missing, Null, Long 1 and \"QP\". Then OpenRecordset snapshot from QP with pN 70, Requery, walk. Then a dynaset over \"SELECT ID, N FROM F\" with Requery(qd) after pN 45, walk. Asks whether Requery re-reads the current parameter value, what the supplied QueryDef replaces, the accepted argument types and the recordset type afterwards. The fixture copy is opened read-only.",
  "callerSurface": "native-idispatch/x64",
  "invokeLcid": 1033,
